{{!
@template block_rajabsgames/badge

One list item per badge: the block's badge list, the block configuration form (with edit and delete
buttons), the badge picker of the video interaction form and the badge popup on the video.

Each item carries the plugin's scoping class itself, because the JavaScript renders it alone and
drops it into containers the plugin does not own. For the same reason it is a div rather than an li:
the popup on the video, the editor's preview and the interaction form's picker are not lists. The
templates whose list (a div with the list role) holds the items include this one through the
itemrole block, which they set to the listitem role; block_main sets it on the items it adds.

Context variables required for this template:
* badges - array of badges: id, name, picture, classes ('filter' greys the picture), used,
  unused, isblock (read-only rendering), mine and badgecount (claimed and placed counts)

Example context (json):
{
    "badges": [
        {
            "id": 1700000001,
            "name": "Explorer",
            "picture": "https://moodle.example/pluginfile.php/27/block_rajabsgames/content/0/explorer.png",
            "classes": "filter",
            "used": false,
            "unused": false,
            "isblock": true,
            "mine": 1,
            "badgecount": 2
        },
        {
            "id": 1700000002,
            "name": "Finisher",
            "picture": "https://moodle.example/pluginfile.php/27/block_rajabsgames/content/0/finisher.png",
            "classes": "",
            "used": true,
            "unused": false,
            "isblock": false
        }
    ]
}
}}
{{#badges}}
{{^unused}}
<div {{$itemrole}}{{/itemrole}} class="block-rajabsgames rg_badge_item iv-mb-2 d-inline-flex flex-column align-items-center iv-rounded-lg bg-light p-2 mb-1 justify-content-between position-relative" data-id="{{id}}">
    <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center w-100">
        <img class="rg_badge_picture {{classes}}"
             src="{{picture}}"
             alt="{{name}}"
             width="60"
             height="60">
        <div class="rg_badge_name py-2 px-1 w-100 {{#isblock}}text-truncate{{/isblock}}" title="{{name}}">{{name}}</div>
    </div>
    {{^isblock}}
    <div class="actions">
        <button class="btn btn-sm iv-mr-1 edit-badge"
                data-id="{{id}}"
                data-used="{{used}}"
                type="button"
                title="{{#str}}editbadge, block_rajabsgames{{/str}}"
                aria-label="{{#str}}editbadge, block_rajabsgames{{/str}}">
            <i class="fa fa-edit" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
        {{^used}}
        <button class="btn btn-sm text-danger delete-badge"
                data-id="{{id}}"
                type="button"
                title="{{#str}}deletebadge, block_rajabsgames{{/str}}"
                aria-label="{{#str}}deletebadge, block_rajabsgames{{/str}}">
            <i class="fa fa-trash" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
        {{/used}}
    </div>
    {{/isblock}}
    {{#isblock}}
    {{#badgecount}}
    <small class="text-muted">
    {{mine}} / {{badgecount}}
    </small>
    {{^classes}}
    <i class="fa fa-check-circle text-success badge-complete position-absolute" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    {{/classes}}
    {{/badgecount}}
    {{/isblock}}
</div>
{{/unused}}
{{/badges}}
